# Normalise line endings to LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# Without this, Git on Windows checks files out with CRLF, and `biome check`
# — which formats to LF — reports every one of the repository's files as
# misformatted. CI failed with 153 errors on windows-latest while passing on
# macOS and Ubuntu, for no reason connected to the code.
#
# `eol=lf` is what makes this a working-tree guarantee rather than only a
# repository-storage one, so a Windows contributor's local `bun run lint`
# agrees with CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must never be touched by normalisation.
*.png binary
*.vsix binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
